          "quote": "We now support Weight-Decomposed Low-Rank Adaptation aka DoRA via #1474. This new method is builds on top of LoRA and has shown very promising results. Especially at lower ranks (e.g. r=8), it should perform much better than LoRA. Right now, only non-quantized nn.Linear layers are supported. If you'd like to give it a try, just pass use_dora=True to your LoraConfig and you're good to go.",
